{"id":"2e7d619feee516bd","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-truth-iteration-limit.md","title":"真理跳跃的闭包阶段","display":"cor-truth-iteration-limit — 真理跳跃的闭包阶段","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-truth-iteration-limit","aliases":["91-cor-truth-iteration-limit","91-cor-iteration-limit"],"display":"cor-truth-iteration-limit — 真理跳跃的闭包阶段","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-iteration]]","[[91-thm-iteration-convergence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-truth-iteration-limit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-truth-iteration-limit</span><span>91-cor-iteration-limit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-truth-iteration-limit — 真理跳跃的闭包阶段"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ebf36f4bba071548\" href=\"?note=ebf36f4bba071548\" title=\"91-df-truth-iteration\">91-df-truth-iteration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b78700f82584ead6\" href=\"?note=b78700f82584ead6\" title=\"91-thm-iteration-convergence\">91-thm-iteration-convergence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\)</span> (真理跳跃)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\">\\(\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 关于包含关系单调)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Gamma_0=\\varnothing\\)</span> (初始阶段)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J(\\Gamma_\\alpha)\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J(\\Gamma_\\alpha)\\)</span> (后继阶段)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\beta\">\\(\\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\beta\\)</span> (极限阶段)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=\\min\\{\\alpha:\\Gamma_\\alpha=\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}\\}\">\\(\\kappa=\\min\\{\\alpha:\\Gamma_\\alpha=\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}\\}\\)</span> (闭包序数)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\n\\land\n\\Gamma_\\kappa=\\Gamma_{\\kappa+1}\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\Gamma_\\kappa=J(\\Gamma_\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\Gamma_\\kappa=\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n\\land\n\\forall\\beta\\geq\\kappa\\,\n\\bigl(\\Gamma_\\beta=\\Gamma_\\kappa\\bigr)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\n\\land\n\\Gamma_\\kappa=\\Gamma_{\\kappa+1}\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\Gamma_\\kappa=J(\\Gamma_\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\Gamma_\\kappa=\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n\\land\n\\forall\\beta\\geq\\kappa\\,\n\\bigl(\\Gamma_\\beta=\\Gamma_\\kappa\\bigr)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里的“极限”是递增集合序列在某个序数阶段稳定，而不是把句子迭代\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{It}_T(n,\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{It}_T(n,\\varphi)\\)</span> 当作数列取分析极限。达到闭包阶段后，\n单调递归的所有后续阶段相同，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_\\kappa\">\\(\\Gamma_\\kappa\\)</span> 即从空集生成的极小固定点。</p>\n<p>闭包序数一般需要超限阶段；只有对指定的有效强 Kleene 跳跃并附加相应\n可计算性定理时，才能进一步给出诸如 Church–Kleene 序数的精确界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"ebf36f4bba071548","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-iteration-convergence","status":"resolved","id":"b78700f82584ead6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-iteration-convergence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J(\\Gamma_\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta<\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa=\\min\\{\\alpha:\\Gamma_\\alpha=\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\n\\land\n\\Gamma_\\kappa=\\Gamma_{\\kappa+1}\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\Gamma_\\kappa=J(\\Gamma_\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\Gamma_\\kappa=\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n\\land\n\\forall\\beta\\geq\\kappa\\,\n\\bigl(\\Gamma_\\beta=\\Gamma_\\kappa\\bigr)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{It}_T(n,\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1575,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["ebf36f4bba071548","b78700f82584ead6"]}